            "subheading": "Hand-knotted rugs for the living room, bedroom and dining room",
            "body": "<p>RUGKARI makes handmade rugs in Bhadohi, India's carpet capital, in pure New Zealand wool. Explore <a href=\"/collections/living-room-rugs\">living room rugs</a>, <a href=\"/collections/bedroom-rugs\">bedroom rugs</a> and <a href=\"/collections/dining-room-rugs\">dining room rugs</a> — each piece made to order by four generations of master karigars.</p>"
