          "type": "seo_block",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Choosing between hand-knotted, hand-tufted and handwoven",
            "body": "<p><a href=\"/collections/hand-knotted\">Hand-knotted rugs</a> are tied knot by knot for heirloom durability. <a href=\"/collections/hand-tufted\">Hand-tufted rugs</a> offer a plush pile and arrive sooner. <a href=\"/collections/hand-loom\">Handwoven rugs</a> are flatwoven on wooden looms for a clean, quiet surface.</p>"
