            "subheading": "Abstract, geometric, traditional and sculpted designs",
            "body": "<p>Browse <a href=\"/collections/abstract-rugs\">abstract</a>, <a href=\"/collections/geometric-rugs\">geometric</a>, <a href=\"/collections/traditional-rugs\">traditional</a>, <a href=\"/collections/modern-rugs\">modern</a>, <a href=\"/collections/floral-rugs\">floral</a> and <a href=\"/collections/solid-rugs\">solid</a> designs — or our signature <a href=\"/collections/unshaped-rugs\">Sculpted Forms</a>, rugs that leave the rectangle behind.</p>"
